<Base title="About Ali Kazmi | Ali Abbas Kazmi" pageType="about" description="About Ali Abbas Kazmi (Ali Kazmi): Computer Science student at University of the People, self-studying backend engineering, interested in technology, music and good food."><div class="wrap inner-page"><p class="eyebrow">~/about</p><h1>More than a<br/>line of code<span class="period">.</span></h1><div class="article-width"><p class="intro">I'm Ali Abbas Kazmi, a Computer Science student, a lifelong learner and someone who likes understanding how things work.</p><p>I'm studying for a BS in Computer Science at the University of the People, with an expected graduation in Q4 2027. Alongside university, I'm self-studying backend engineering, learning by building and exploring.</p><h2>Beyond the screen</h2><p>I like taking solo walks, listening to Radiohead, replaying Red Dead Redemption 2 and discovering good food. Sometimes the best ideas happen when I'm doing absolutely none of the technical stuff.</p><h2>About this space</h2><p>This site is both a personal project and a place to keep track of the things I learn. For now, it is a home for my projects and a little about me. Everything is intentionally simple.</p><p class="endnote">One step at a time.</p></div></div></Base>
